<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.10">
<l>tollaru ṇalviṉaiyāl collakkūṭuṅkol tōḻimīrkā</l>
<l>ṭollaruṇ maṇṇumviṇṇun toḻaniṉṟa tirunakara</l>
<l>nallaru ḷāyiravar nalaṉēntun tiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>nallaru ṇamperumāṉ nārāyaṇaṉ nāmaṅkaḷē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Is it possible, by [our] good Karma, to speak, friends, the ancient grace</l>
<l>[that is] the names of our great lord Nārāyaṇaṉ of good grace</l>
<l>from Tiruvallavāḻ, where thousands of good grace offer [their] goodness(?),</l>
<l>the sacred city, where earth and heaven of ancient grace stood to worship?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
